  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/EiraView">
    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">EIRA View</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">DEFINITION:
EIRA view ABB is a Business Object containing a graphical notation of the EIRA ontology. The EIRA consists of several architecture views (1) , including one view for each of the EIF interoperability levels.

(1) An architecture view is a representation of a system from the perspective of a related set of concerns.

Source: TOGAF (&lt;a href=&quot;https://pubs.opengroup.org/architecture/togaf9-doc/arch/chap03.html#tag_03_17&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://pubs.opengroup.org/architecture/togaf9-doc/arch/chap03.html#tag…&lt;/a&gt;)

EXAMPLES:
