    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">DEFINITION:
Interoperability Specification ABB is a Business Object being embodied as a document of the highest possible level of granularity on an EIRA SBB, formulated as an agreed normative statement in design terms on a legal, organisational, semantic, or technical attribute of an European Public Service.  It  can refer to existing  standards or  specifications

Source: ISA2 – EIA Action (&lt;a href=&quot;https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/eif_en&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/eif_en&lt;/a&gt;.)

