    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Solution Specification</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">DEFINITION:
Solution Specification ABB is a Business Object being embodied as a document of the highest possible level of granularity on an Solution Building Block, formulated as an agreed normative statement in design of an European Public Service.

Source: ISO
(&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.iso.org/standard/40359.html&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://www.iso.org/standard/40359.html&lt;/a&gt;)

