    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Formulation of Public Policy Scenarios</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A Formulation of Public Policy Scenarios is a stage where a number of public policy options for addressing the problem and achieving the public policy objectives are developed.

