  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ImpactAssessment">
    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Impact Assessment</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An Impact assessment is a key tool to ensure that the public policy process is carried out on the basis of transparent, comprehensive and balanced evidence, an Impact assessment is an aid to political decision-making.

Source: Based on the concepts laid out in  &lt;a href=&quot;http://ec.europa.eu/smart-regulation/impact/commission_guidelines/docs/iag_2009_en.pdf&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://ec.europa.eu/smart-regulation/impact/commission_guidelines/docs/…&lt;/a&gt;</skos:definition>
