  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/AgentBusinessRole">
    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Agent</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: Agent ABB is a Business Role defined as an Entity that is able to carry out action.

Source: SEMIC-CPV or SEMIC-CCCEV

Source reference: &lt;a href=&quot;https://semiceu.github.io/Core-Person-Vocabulary/releases/2.00/#Agent&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://semiceu.github.io/Core-Person-Vocabulary/releases/2.00/#Agent&lt;/a&gt;

Example: The following implementation is an example of how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): foaf:Agent An agent (eg. person, group, software or physical artifact). (&lt;a href=&quot;http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/#term_Agent&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/#term_Agent&lt;/a&gt;)

LOST view: Organisational view

Interoperability saliency: The Agent ABB is salient for organizational and behavioural interoperability because it permits the identification of procedures and business rules related to specific organizations, individuals or public services that facilitates the exchange of data, information and knowledge between digital public services.

Identifier: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/AgentBusinessRole&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/AgentBusinessRole&lt;/a&gt;

eira:ID: ABB498

ABB name: eira:AgentBusinessRole

EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2023-12-01</skos:definition>
    <skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/view/OrganisationalView"/>
    <ns1:properties rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">{&quot;namespaces&quot;:{&quot;rdf&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;rdf:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/1999\/02\/22-rdf-syntax-ns#&quot;},&quot;skos&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;skos:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#&quot;},&quot;dct&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;dct:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/purl.org\/dc\/terms\/&quot;},&quot;eira&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;eira:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/&quot;}},&quot;rows&quot;:[{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;rdf:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#Concept&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:notation&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of Agent&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/AgentBusinessRole_Properties&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/AgentBusinessRole&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:prefLabel&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of Agent&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:PURI&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/AgentBusinessRole&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:AgentBusinessRole&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:modified&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;2023-12-1&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:definition&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Agent ABB is a Business Role defined as an Entity that is able to carry out action.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSource&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;SEMIC-CPV or SEMIC-CCCEV&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSourceReference&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/semiceu.github.io\/Core-Person-Vocabulary\/releases\/2.00\/#Agent&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:example&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The following implementation is an example of how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): foaf:Agent An agent (eg. person, group, software or physical artifact). (http:\/\/xmlns.com\/foaf\/0.1\/#term_Agent)&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopSaliency&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The Agent ABB is salient for organizational and behavioural interoperability because it permits the identification of procedures and business rules related to specific organizations, individuals or public services that facilitates the exchange of data, information and knowledge between digital public services.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:concept&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Structural IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Behavioral IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:view&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Organisational view&quot;}]}</ns1:properties>
    <skos:related>
      <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/DigitalPublicServiceDeliveryProviderBusinessRole">
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Digital Public Service Provider</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: Digital Public Service Provider ABB is a Business Role representing  the entity that offer or deliver public services using digital channels and technologies. Digital public service providers aim to provide efficient and accessible services to citizens and businesses by leveraging the power of digital technology.

Source: Inspired on the information available in Digital Public Services  in the Digital Economy and Society Index

Source reference: &lt;a href=&quot;https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/policies/desi-digital-public-services&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/policies/desi-digital-public-s…&lt;/a&gt;

Example: The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): The Spanish Tax Agency is responsible for providing Digital Public Services on TAX payment. &lt;a href=&quot;https://sede.agenciatributaria.gob.es/Sede/en_gb/iva.html&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://sede.agenciatributaria.gob.es/Sede/en_gb/iva.html&lt;/a&gt;

LOST view: Organisational view

Interoperability saliency: The Digital Public Service Provider ABB is salient for organizational and semantic interoperability because it offers (i) mechanisms to exchange information transparently; (ii) manage the information with needed security and trust; (iii) combine and harmonise information coming from multiple data stores to give service to the different agents (or stakeholders)

Identifier: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/DigitalPublicServiceDeliveryProviderBusinessRole&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/DigitalPublicServiceDeliveryProviderBusinessR…&lt;/a&gt;

eira:ID: ABB503

ABB name: eira:DigitalPublicServiceDeliveryProviderBusinessRole

EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2023-12-01</skos:definition>
