  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/DigitalPublicBusinessService">
    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Digital Public Service</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: Digital Public Service ABB is a Business Service that enables the implementation of a Public Administration digital business capability, provisioned via a digital service delivery mode by, or on behalf of a public administration. A Digital Public Service comprises any digital public service exposed to a cross-border dimension in the European Union.

Source: EIF, ISA2 Core Vocabularies, IMM

Source reference: [&lt;a href=&quot;http://eur-lex.europa.eu/resource.html?uri=cellar:2c2f2554-0faf-11e7-8a35-01aa75ed71a1.0017.02/DOC_3&amp;amp;format=PDF][https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/actions/assessing-progress-being-made-towards-interoperability_en&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://eur-lex.europa.eu/resource.html?uri=cellar:2c2f2554-0faf-11e7-8a…&lt;/a&gt;] [&lt;a href=&quot;https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/catalogue/distribution/cpsv-ap-specification-v20-pdf&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/catalogue/distribution/cpsv-ap-specificatio…&lt;/a&gt;]

Example: The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): EUROPASS2 - Make better use of skills and opportunities across Europe. Europass is a service to help individuals to communicate their skills, qualifications and experience through the use of standardised documents templates. (&lt;a href=&quot;http://ec.europa.eu/social/main.jsp&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://ec.europa.eu/social/main.jsp&lt;/a&gt;?

LOST view: Organisational view

Interoperability saliency: The Digital Public Service ABB is salient for the organizational, semantic and technical interoperability because it represents the materialization of the service delivery in terms of (i) a common mechanism to give a response to a specific public administration procedure, (ii) data harmonization to facilitate the comprehension of the information, (iii) specific mechanisms to consume, share and reuse the information.

Identifier: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/DigitalPublicBusinessService&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/DigitalPublicBusinessService&lt;/a&gt;

eira:ID: ABB444

ABB name: eira:DigitalPublicBusinessService

EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2023-11-01</skos:definition>
    <skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/viewpoint/HighlevelViewpoint"/>
    <ns1:properties rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">{&quot;namespaces&quot;:{&quot;rdf&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;rdf:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/1999\/02\/22-rdf-syntax-ns#&quot;},&quot;skos&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;skos:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#&quot;},&quot;dct&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;dct:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/purl.org\/dc\/terms\/&quot;},&quot;eira&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;eira:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/&quot;}},&quot;rows&quot;:[{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;rdf:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#Concept&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:notation&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of Digital Public Service&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/DigitalPublicBusinessService_Properties&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/DigitalPublicBusinessService&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:prefLabel&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of Digital Public Service&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:PURI&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/DigitalPublicBusinessService&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:DigitalPublicBusinessService&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:modified&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;2023-11-1&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:definition&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Digital Public Service ABB is a Business Service that enables the implementation of a Public Administration digital business capability, provisioned via a digital service delivery mode by, or on behalf of a public administration. A Digital Public Service comprises any digital public service exposed to a cross-border dimension in the European Union.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSource&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;EIF, ISA2 Core Vocabularies, IMM&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSourceReference&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;[http:\/\/eur-lex.europa.eu\/resource.html?uri=cellar:2c2f2554-0faf-11e7-8a35-01aa75ed71a1.0017.02\/DOC_3\u0026format=PDF][https:\/\/ec.europa.eu\/isa2\/actions\/assessing-progress-being-made-towards-interoperability_en] [https:\/\/joinup.ec.europa.eu\/catalogue\/distribution\/cpsv-ap-specification-v20-pdf]&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:example&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): EUROPASS2 - Make better use of skills and opportunities across Europe. Europass is a service to help individuals to communicate their skills, qualifications and experience through the use of standardised documents templates. (http:\/\/ec.europa.eu\/social\/main.jsp?&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopSaliency&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The Digital Public Service ABB is salient for the organizational, semantic and technical interoperability because it represents the materialization of the service delivery in terms of (i) a common mechanism to give a response to a specific public administration procedure, (ii) data harmonization to facilitate the comprehension of the information, (iii) specific mechanisms to consume, share and reuse the information.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:concept&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Structural IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Behavioral IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:view&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Organisational view&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:viewpoint&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Interoperability Privacy viewpoint&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:viewpoint&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Highlevel viewpoint&quot;}]}</ns1:properties>
