  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/SharedInfrastructureContentGrouping">
    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Shared Infrastructure Content</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: Shared Infrastructure Content ABB is a Grouping that refers to the set of tools and services that pools IT infrastructure provided by the service provider (e.g. hardware, operating system software, associated operating processes and tools) that can be physically used by several users at the time, thus being &quot;shared&quot;. In particular, the service provider ensures compliance with all security standards and the logical separation of data and applications

Source: Joinup

Source reference: &lt;a href=&quot;https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/nifo-national-interoperability-framework-observatory/glossary/term/shared-infrastructure&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/nifo-national-interoperability-f…&lt;/a&gt;

LOST view: Technical view - Infrastructure

Interoperability saliency: Shared Infrastructure Content ABB is a key interoperability enabler (*) for structural, behavioural and governance interoperability. It is salient for technical interoperability because it determines the tools and services that can be used by stakeholders or other digital services to interconnect services and data. This ABB also technically establish security standards compliance to deliver such public services.

Identifier: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/SharedInfrastructureContentGrouping&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/SharedInfrastructureContentGrouping&lt;/a&gt;

eira:ID: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/SharedInfrastructureContentGrouping&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/SharedInfrastructureContentGrouping&lt;/a&gt;

ABB name: eira:SharedInfrastructureContentGrouping

EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2022-31-01</skos:definition>
    <skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/viewpoint/InteroperableEuropeanSolutionViewpoint"/>
    <ns1:properties rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">{&quot;namespaces&quot;:{&quot;rdf&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;rdf:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/1999\/02\/22-rdf-syntax-ns#&quot;},&quot;skos&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;skos:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#&quot;},&quot;dct&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;dct:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/purl.org\/dc\/terms\/&quot;},&quot;eira&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;eira:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/&quot;}},&quot;rows&quot;:[{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;rdf:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#Concept&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:notation&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of Shared Infrastructure Content&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/SharedInfrastructureContentGrouping_Properties&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/SharedInfrastructureContentGrouping&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:prefLabel&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of Shared Infrastructure Content&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:PURI&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/SharedInfrastructureContentGrouping&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:SharedInfrastructureContentGrouping&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:modified&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;2022-01-31&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:definition&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Shared Infrastructure Content ABB is a Grouping that refers to the set of tools and services that pools IT infrastructure provided by the service provider (e.g. hardware, operating system software, associated operating processes and tools) that can be physically used by several users at the time, thus being \u0022shared\u0022. In particular, the service provider ensures compliance with all security standards and the logical separation of data and applications&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSource&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Joinup&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSourceReference&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/joinup.ec.europa.eu\/collection\/nifo-national-interoperability-framework-observatory\/glossary\/term\/shared-infrastructure&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopSaliency&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Shared Infrastructure Content ABB is a key interoperability enabler (*) for structural, behavioural and governance interoperability. It is salient for technical interoperability because it determines the tools and services that can be used by stakeholders or other digital services to interconnect services and data. This ABB also technically establish security standards compliance to deliver such public services.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:concept&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Structural IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Behavioral IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:view&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Technical view - infrastructure&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:viewpoint&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Highlevel viewpoint&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:viewpoint&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Key Interoperability Enablers viewpoint&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:viewpoint&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;EIRA Ontology viewpoint&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:viewpoint&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Interoperable European Solution viewpoint&quot;}]}</ns1:properties>
    <skos:related>
      <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/TechnologyTechnologyInterface">
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Technology Interface</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: Technology Interface ABB is a Technology Interface that enables a point of access where services offered by an infrastructure can be accessed

Source: Inspired in Archimate

Source reference: &lt;a href=&quot;https://pubs.opengroup.org/architecture/archimate3-doc/chap10.html&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://pubs.opengroup.org/architecture/archimate3-doc/chap10.html&lt;/a&gt;

Synonym:

Additional information:

IoP Dimension: Behavioural IoP

LOST view: Technical view - Infrastructure

Interoperability saliency: Technology Interface ABB is a key interoperability enabler (*) for behavioural, technical and semantic interoperability by enabling interfaces and access points to the architectures for infrastructure-to-infrastructure data exchange.

Identifier: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/TechnologyTechnologyInterface&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/TechnologyTechnologyInterface&lt;/a&gt;

