  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/FirewallApplicationService">
    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Firewall Service</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: Firewall Service ABB is an Application Service representing an integrated collection of security measures designed to prevent unauthorized electronic access to a networked computer system.

Source: Dictionary

Source reference: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dictionary.com/browse/firewall&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://www.dictionary.com/browse/firewall&lt;/a&gt;

