    <ns1:properties rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">{&quot;namespaces&quot;:{&quot;rdf&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;rdf:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/1999\/02\/22-rdf-syntax-ns#&quot;},&quot;skos&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;skos:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#&quot;},&quot;dct&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;dct:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/purl.org\/dc\/terms\/&quot;},&quot;eira&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;eira:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/&quot;}},&quot;rows&quot;:[{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;rdf:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#Concept&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:notation&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of API Catalogue&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/APICatalogueApplicationComponent_Properties&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/APICatalogueApplicationComponent&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:prefLabel&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of API Catalogue&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:PURI&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/APICatalogueApplicationComponent&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:APICatalogueApplicationComponent&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:modified&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;2022-01-18&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:definition&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;API Catalogue ABB is an Application Component that refers to the (open) software interfaces functionalities that are aligned with the implementation structure of the digital services.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSource&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Inspired in Archimate\u00a9&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSourceReference&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/pubs.opengroup.org\/architecture\/archimate3-doc\/chap09.html#_Toc10045392&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:example&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): RapidAPI - RapidAPI is a collection of predefined APIs that are free to test, specifically updated for 2021. https:\/\/rapidapi.com\/collection\/list-of-free-apis&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopSaliency&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The API Catalogue Catalogue Application Component ABB is salient for interoperability because the component is relevant for the software interfaces functionalities aligned with the implementation structures of solutions and digital public services. Those features and functionalities enable data consumption, processing and provision between digital public services.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:concept&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Structural IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Behavioral IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:view&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Technical view - application&quot;}]}</ns1:properties>
    <skos:related>
      <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/APIDiscoveryandCatalogueApplicationService">
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">API Discovery and Catalogue</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: API Discovery and Catalogue Service ABB is an Application Service that enables the discovery and/or maintenance of the API Catalogue ABB.

Source: Inspired in Gartner

Source reference: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gartner.com/en/information-technology/glossary/application-programming-interface&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://www.gartner.com/en/information-technology/glossary/application-…&lt;/a&gt;

Example: The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): RapidAPI - RapidAPI is a collection of predefined APIs that are free to test, specifically updated for 2021. &lt;a href=&quot;https://rapidapi.com/collection/list-of-free-apis&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://rapidapi.com/collection/list-of-free-apis&lt;/a&gt;

IoP Dimension: Structural IoP, Behavioral IoP

LOST view: Technical view - application

Interoperability saliency: API Discovery and Catalogue Application Service ABB is a key interoperability enabler (*) for structural and behavioural interoperability by enabling and maintaining API Catalogues for public administration services. This is a key aspect enabling interoperability as it contributes to the discovery of APIs through catalogues.

Identifier: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/APIDiscoveryandCatalogueApplicationService&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/APIDiscoveryandCatalogueApplicationService&lt;/a&gt;

eira:ID: ABB433

ABB name: eira:APIDiscoveryandCatalogueApplicationService

EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2022-18-01</skos:definition>
