  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ServiceRegistryApplicationComponent">
    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Service Registry</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: Service Registry ABB is an Application Component that enables the registering of system services within a catalogue to facilitate the discovery of services.

Source: ISA2 - EIA Action

Source reference: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/eli/dec/2015/2240/oj&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/eli/dec/2015/2240/oj&lt;/a&gt;

Example: The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): jUDDI - jUDDI is an open source Java implementation of OASIS Universal Description, Discovery, and Integration (UDDI) specification for (Web) Services. &lt;a href=&quot;https://juddi.apache.org/&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://juddi.apache.org/&lt;/a&gt;

IoP Dimension: Structural IoP

LOST view: Technical view - Infrastructure

Interoperability saliency: The Service Registry Component ABB  is a key interoperability enabler because it supports to achieve technical interoperability by provisioning and consuming back-office services as stated in the EIF recommendation n°44: &quot;Put in place catalogues of public services, public data, and interoperability solutions and use common models for describing them.&quot;

Identifier: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ServiceRegistryApplicationComponent&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ServiceRegistryApplicationComponent&lt;/a&gt;

eira:ID: ABB133

ABB name: eira:ServiceRegistryApplicationComponent

EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2022-18-01</skos:definition>
    <skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/view/TechnicalView-Application"/>
    <ns1:properties rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">{&quot;namespaces&quot;:{&quot;rdf&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;rdf:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/1999\/02\/22-rdf-syntax-ns#&quot;},&quot;skos&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;skos:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#&quot;},&quot;dct&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;dct:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/purl.org\/dc\/terms\/&quot;},&quot;eira&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;eira:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/&quot;}},&quot;rows&quot;:[{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;rdf:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#Concept&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:notation&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of Service Registry&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/ServiceRegistryApplicationComponent_Properties&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/ServiceRegistryApplicationComponent&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:prefLabel&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of Service Registry&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:PURI&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/ServiceRegistryApplicationComponent&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:ServiceRegistryApplicationComponent&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:modified&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;2022-01-18&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:definition&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Service Registry ABB is an Application Component that enables the registering of system services within a catalogue to facilitate the discovery of services.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSource&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;ISA2 - EIA Action&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSourceReference&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/eli\/dec\/2015\/2240\/oj&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:example&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): jUDDI - jUDDI is an open source Java implementation of OASIS Universal Description, Discovery, and Integration (UDDI) specification for (Web) Services. https:\/\/juddi.apache.org\/&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopSaliency&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The Service Registry Component ABB \u00a0is a key interoperability enabler because it supports to achieve technical interoperability by provisioning and consuming back-office services as stated in the EIF recommendation n\u00b044: \u0022Put in place catalogues of public services, public data, and interoperability solutions and use common models for describing them.\u0022&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:concept&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Structural IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:view&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Technical view - application&quot;}]}</ns1:properties>
    <skos:related>
      <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/DiscoveryandRegistryServiceApplicationService">
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Service Discovery and Registry</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: Service Discovery and Registry ABB is an Application Service that enables the process of automatically locating network services within distributed digital systems.

Source: Inspired in INSPIRE

Source reference: &lt;a href=&quot;https://inspire.ec.europa.eu/glossary/DiscoveryService&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://inspire.ec.europa.eu/glossary/DiscoveryService&lt;/a&gt;

Example: The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): ZooKeeper - ZooKeeper is a centralized service registry for maintaining configuration information, naming, providing distributed synchronization, and providing group services. All of these kinds of services are used in some form or another by distributed applications. Each time they are implemented there is a lot of work that goes into fixing the bugs and race conditions that are inevitable. Because of the difficulty of implementing these kinds of services, applications initially usually skimp on them, which make them brittle in the presence of change and difficult to manage. Even when done correctly, different implementations of these services lead to management complexity when the applications are deployed. &lt;a href=&quot;https://zookeeper.apache.org/&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://zookeeper.apache.org/&lt;/a&gt;

IoP Dimension: Structural IoP, Behavioral IoP

LOST view: Technical view - application

Interoperability saliency: Service Discovery and Registry Service ABB is a key interoperability enabler (*) for structural and behavioural interoperability by enabling access rights for data that is necessary for accessing public administration components to target fast and easy communication and data exchange.

Identifier: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/DiscoveryandRegistryServiceApplicationService&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/DiscoveryandRegistryServiceApplicationService&lt;/a&gt;

eira:ID: ABB432

ABB name: eira:DiscoveryandRegistryServiceApplicationService

EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2022-18-01</skos:definition>
        <skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/viewpoint/KeyInteroperabilityEnablersViewpoint"/>
        <ns1:properties rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">{&quot;namespaces&quot;:{&quot;rdf&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;rdf:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/1999\/02\/22-rdf-syntax-ns#&quot;},&quot;skos&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;skos:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#&quot;},&quot;dct&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;dct:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/purl.org\/dc\/terms\/&quot;},&quot;eira&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;eira:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/&quot;}},&quot;rows&quot;:[{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;rdf:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#Concept&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:notation&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of Service Discovery and Registry&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/DiscoveryandRegistryServiceApplicationService_Properties&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/DiscoveryandRegistryServiceApplicationService&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:prefLabel&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of Service Discovery and Registry&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:PURI&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/DiscoveryandRegistryServiceApplicationService&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:DiscoveryandRegistryServiceApplicationService&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:modified&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;2022-01-18&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:definition&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Service Discovery and Registry ABB is an Application Service that enables the process of automatically locating network services within distributed digital systems.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSource&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Inspired in INSPIRE&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSourceReference&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/inspire.ec.europa.eu\/glossary\/DiscoveryService&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:example&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): ZooKeeper - ZooKeeper is a centralized service registry for maintaining configuration information, naming, providing distributed synchronization, and providing group services. All of these kinds of services are used in some form or another by distributed applications. Each time they are implemented there is a lot of work that goes into fixing the bugs and race conditions that are inevitable. Because of the difficulty of implementing these kinds of services, applications initially usually skimp on them, which make them brittle in the presence of change and difficult to manage. Even when done correctly, different implementations of these services lead to management complexity when the applications are deployed. https:\/\/zookeeper.apache.org\/&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopSaliency&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Service Discovery and Registry Service ABB is a key interoperability enabler (*) for structural and behavioural interoperability by enabling access rights for data that is necessary for accessing public administration components to target fast and easy communication and data exchange.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:concept&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Structural IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Behavioral IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:view&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Technical view - application&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:viewpoint&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Key Interoperability Enablers viewpoint&quot;}]}</ns1:properties>
