  </skos:Concept>

  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/E-SealPreservationApplicationService">
    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">e-Seal Preservation</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: e-Seal Preservation ABB is an Application Service that enables the procedures to extend the trustworthiness of the qualified electronic signature beyond the technological validity period.

Source: eIDAS - REGULATION (EU) No 910/2014 OF THE EUROPEAN PARLIAMENT AND OF THE COUNCIL of 23 July 2014 on electronic identification and trust services for electronic transactions in the internal market and repealing Directive 1999/93/EC.

Source reference: &lt;a href=&quot;http://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=uriserv%3AOJ.L_.2014.257.01.0073.01.ENG&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=uriserv%3AOJ.L_.2014…&lt;/a&gt;

Additional information: An ‘electronic seal' means data in electronic form, which is attached to or logically associated with other data in electronic form to ensure the latter’s origin and integrity. The ‘creator of a seal’ is a legal person who creates an electronic seal.

Example: The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): CEF eSignature DSS - DSS (Digital Signature Services) is an open-source software library for electronic signature creation and validation. DSS supports the creation and verification of interoperable and secure electronic signatures in line with European legislation. In particular, DSS aims to follow the eIDAS Regulation and related standards closely. DSS can be re-used in an IT solution for electronic signatures to ensure that signatures are created and verified in line with European legislation and standards. DSS allows re-use in a variety of different ways: in an applet, in a stand-alone application or in a server application. DSS can also be used as a reference implementation for IT solutions which do not directly re-use it. CEF eSignature's DSS open-source library delivers the following benefits to its users: •	Open-source software under LGPL 2.1, a non-viral open source license; •	Interoperability of the e-signatures; •	Supports both e-signatures and e-seals; •	Validation of countersignatures and multiple signatures; •	Alignment with the eIDAS Regulation and related standards; •	Supports EU standards on: o	Signature formats and packaging methods;  o	Signature validation procedures; •	Validation relying on Member States' trusted lists: o	Status of trust service providers/trust service, compensation of information, path validation. &lt;a href=&quot;https://ec.europa.eu/cefdigital/wiki/display/CEFDIGITAL/eSignaturefile:///C:/Users/bocquilp/Downloads/DSS(ServiceOfferingDescription)%20(v0.03)%20(5).pdf&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://ec.europa.eu/cefdigital/wiki/display/CEFDIGITAL/eSignaturefile:…&lt;/a&gt;

IoP Dimension: Behavioral IoP

LOST view: Technical view - Infrastructure

Interoperability saliency: The e-Seal Preservation Service ABB  is salient for technical interoperability  because it provides the functionalities required for e-seal preservation service.

Identifier: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/E-SealPreservationApplicationService&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/E-SealPreservationApplicationService&lt;/a&gt;

eira:ID: ABB200

ABB name: eira:E-SealPreservationApplicationService

EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2022-20-01</skos:definition>
    <skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/viewpoint/InteroperabilitySecurityViewpoint"/>
    <ns1:properties rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">{&quot;namespaces&quot;:{&quot;rdf&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;rdf:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/1999\/02\/22-rdf-syntax-ns#&quot;},&quot;skos&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;skos:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#&quot;},&quot;dct&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;dct:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/purl.org\/dc\/terms\/&quot;},&quot;eira&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;eira:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/&quot;}},&quot;rows&quot;:[{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;rdf:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#Concept&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:notation&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of e-Seal Preservation&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/E-SealPreservationApplicationService_Properties&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/E-SealPreservationApplicationService&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:prefLabel&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of e-Seal Preservation&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:PURI&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/E-SealPreservationApplicationService&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:E-SealPreservationApplicationService&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:modified&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;2022-01-20&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:definition&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;e-Seal Preservation ABB is an Application Service that enables the procedures to extend the trustworthiness of the qualified electronic signature beyond the technological validity period.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSource&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eIDAS - REGULATION (EU) No 910\/2014 OF THE EUROPEAN PARLIAMENT AND OF THE COUNCIL of 23 July 2014 on electronic identification and trust services for electronic transactions in the internal market and repealing Directive 1999\/93\/EC.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSourceReference&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/eur-lex.europa.eu\/legal-content\/EN\/TXT\/?uri=uriserv%3AOJ.L_.2014.257.01.0073.01.ENG&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:example&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): CEF eSignature DSS - DSS (Digital Signature Services) is an open-source software library for electronic signature creation and validation. DSS supports the creation and verification of interoperable and secure electronic signatures in line with European legislation. In particular, DSS aims to follow the eIDAS Regulation and related standards closely. DSS can be re-used in an IT solution for electronic signatures to ensure that signatures are created and verified in line with European legislation and standards. DSS allows re-use in a variety of different ways: in an applet, in a stand-alone application or in a server application. DSS can also be used as a reference implementation for IT solutions which do not directly re-use it. CEF eSignature\u0027s DSS open-source library delivers the following benefits to its users: \u2022\tOpen-source software under LGPL 2.1, a non-viral open source license; \u2022\tInteroperability of the e-signatures; \u2022\tSupports both e-signatures and e-seals; \u2022\tValidation of countersignatures and multiple signatures; \u2022\tAlignment with the eIDAS Regulation and related standards; \u2022\tSupports EU standards on: o\tSignature formats and packaging methods;  o\tSignature validation procedures; \u2022\tValidation relying on Member States\u0027 trusted lists: o\tStatus of trust service providers\/trust service, compensation of information, path validation. https:\/\/ec.europa.eu\/cefdigital\/wiki\/display\/CEFDIGITAL\/eSignaturefile:\/\/\/C:\/Users\/bocquilp\/Downloads\/DSS(ServiceOfferingDescription)%20(v0.03)%20(5).pdf&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopSaliency&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The e-Seal Preservation Service ABB \u00a0is salient for technical interoperability  because it provides the functionalities required for e-seal preservation service.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:note&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;An \u2018electronic seal\u0027 means data in electronic form, which is attached to or logically associated with other data in electronic form to ensure the latter\u2019s origin and integrity. The \u2018creator of a seal\u2019 is a legal person who creates an electronic seal.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:concept&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Behavioral IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:view&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Technical view - application&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:viewpoint&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Interoperability Security viewpoint&quot;}]}</ns1:properties>
  </skos:Concept>

  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/viewpoint/InteroperabilitySecurityViewpoint">
    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Interoperability Security Viewpoint</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en"></skos:definition>
  </skos:Concept>

  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/DataExchangeApplicationService">
    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Data Exchange</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: Data Exchange ABB is an Application Service enabling the secure exchange of messages, records, forms and other kinds of data between different individuals, organizations or systems. This includes data routing, except endpoint discovery.

Source: EIFv2

Source reference: &lt;a href=&quot;http://ec.europa.eu/isa/documents/isa_annex_ii_eif_en.pdf&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://ec.europa.eu/isa/documents/isa_annex_ii_eif_en.pdf&lt;/a&gt;

Example: The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): XMLGate - XMLGate is a Web service application used to validate an XML instance against a well-defined schema. The XML flow is submitted either via a PDF form or by uploading the XML file.(&lt;a href=&quot;https://webgate.ec.europa.eu/sanco-xmlgate/Login.jsp;jsessionid=2MPn_N5Wg9Dar4_W2-yVL_Xg-VlW3kn47PLVbNise9X5Kycx1yLI!-25226473&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://webgate.ec.europa.eu/sanco-xmlgate/Login.jsp;jsessionid=2MPn_N5…&lt;/a&gt;)

IoP Dimension: Behavioral IoP

LOST view: Technical view - Infrastructure

Interoperability saliency: The Data Exchange Service ABB is a key interoperability enabler (*) for behavioural and technical interoperability because it provides secure and trustworthy data exchange between different ICT systems as stated in the EIF: &quot;Define a common security and privacy framework and establish processes for public services to ensure secure and trustworthy data exchange between public administrations and in interactions with citizens and businesses.&quot;

Identifier: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/DataExchangeApplicationService&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/DataExchangeApplicationService&lt;/a&gt;

eira:ID: ABB43

ABB name: eira:DataExchangeApplicationService

EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2022-18-01</skos:definition>
    <skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/viewpoint/KeyInteroperabilityEnablersViewpoint"/>
    <ns1:properties rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">{&quot;namespaces&quot;:{&quot;rdf&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;rdf:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/1999\/02\/22-rdf-syntax-ns#&quot;},&quot;skos&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;skos:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#&quot;},&quot;dct&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;dct:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/purl.org\/dc\/terms\/&quot;},&quot;eira&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;eira:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/&quot;}},&quot;rows&quot;:[{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;rdf:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#Concept&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:notation&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of Data Exchange&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/DataExchangeApplicationService_Properties&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/DataExchangeApplicationService&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:prefLabel&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of Data Exchange&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:PURI&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/DataExchangeApplicationService&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:DataExchangeApplicationService&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:modified&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;2022-01-18&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:definition&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Data Exchange ABB is an Application Service enabling the secure exchange of messages, records, forms and other kinds of data between different individuals, organizations or systems. This includes data routing, except endpoint discovery.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSource&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;EIFv2&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSourceReference&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/ec.europa.eu\/isa\/documents\/isa_annex_ii_eif_en.pdf&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:example&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): XMLGate - XMLGate is a Web service application used to validate an XML instance against a well-defined schema. The XML flow is submitted either via a PDF form or by uploading the XML file.(https:\/\/webgate.ec.europa.eu\/sanco-xmlgate\/Login.jsp;jsessionid=2MPn_N5Wg9Dar4_W2-yVL_Xg-VlW3kn47PLVbNise9X5Kycx1yLI!-25226473)&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopSaliency&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The Data Exchange Service ABB is a key interoperability enabler (*) for behavioural and technical interoperability because it provides secure and trustworthy data exchange between different ICT systems as stated in the EIF: \u0022Define a common security and privacy framework and establish processes for public services to ensure secure and trustworthy data exchange between public administrations and in interactions with citizens and businesses.\u0022&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:concept&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Behavioral IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:view&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Technical view - application&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:viewpoint&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Interoperability Security viewpoint&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:viewpoint&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Interoperability Privacy viewpoint&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:viewpoint&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Key Interoperability Enablers viewpoint&quot;}]}</ns1:properties>
    <skos:related rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/DataObject"/>
  </skos:Concept>

  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/APICatalogueDataObject">
    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">API Catalogue</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: API Catalogue ABB is a Data Object that corresponds to a collection of (open) software interfaces that allow data consumption by a specific digital solution

Source: Inspired in JRC

Source reference: &lt;a href=&quot;https://data.jrc.ec.europa.eu/dataset/5a431f38-1e2c-449a-898e-34f2a3234c3b&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://data.jrc.ec.europa.eu/dataset/5a431f38-1e2c-449a-898e-34f2a3234…&lt;/a&gt;

Example: The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): RapidAPI - RapidAPI is a collection of predefined APIs that are free to test, specifically updated for 2021. &lt;a href=&quot;https://rapidapi.com/collection/list-of-free-apis&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://rapidapi.com/collection/list-of-free-apis&lt;/a&gt;

LOST view: Technical view - application

Interoperability saliency: The API Catalogue Data Object ABB is salient for interoperability as it is a collection of software interfaces that allows data consumption between solutions and services.

Identifier: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/APICatalogueDataObject&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/APICatalogueDataObject&lt;/a&gt;

eira:ID: ABB435

ABB name: eira:APICatalogueDataObject

EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2022-18-01</skos:definition>
    <skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/view/TechnicalView-Application"/>
    <ns1:properties rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">{&quot;namespaces&quot;:{&quot;rdf&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;rdf:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/1999\/02\/22-rdf-syntax-ns#&quot;},&quot;skos&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;skos:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#&quot;},&quot;dct&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;dct:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/purl.org\/dc\/terms\/&quot;},&quot;eira&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;eira:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/&quot;}},&quot;rows&quot;:[{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;rdf:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#Concept&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:notation&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of API Catalogue&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/APICatalogueDataObject_Properties&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/APICatalogueDataObject&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:prefLabel&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of API Catalogue&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:PURI&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/APICatalogueDataObject&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:APICatalogueDataObject&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:modified&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;2022-01-18&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:definition&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;API Catalogue ABB is a Data Object that corresponds to a collection of (open) software interfaces that allow data consumption by a specific digital solution&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSource&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Inspired in JRC&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSourceReference&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/data.jrc.ec.europa.eu\/dataset\/5a431f38-1e2c-449a-898e-34f2a3234c3b&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:example&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): RapidAPI - RapidAPI is a collection of predefined APIs that are free to test, specifically updated for 2021. https:\/\/rapidapi.com\/collection\/list-of-free-apis&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopSaliency&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The API Catalogue Data Object ABB is salient for interoperability as it is a collection of software interfaces that allows data consumption between solutions and services.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:concept&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Structural IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Behavioral IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:view&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Technical view - application&quot;}]}</ns1:properties>
