  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/PhysicalSecurityInfrastructureEquipment">
    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Physical Security Infrastructure</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: Physical Security Infrastructure ABB is Equipment that enables the protection of facilities and assets from actions and events that could cause damage or losses.

Source: Inspired in Gartner

Source reference: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gartner.com/en/information-technology/glossary/physical-security&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://www.gartner.com/en/information-technology/glossary/physical-sec…&lt;/a&gt;

LOST view: Technical view - Infrastructure

Interoperability saliency: The Physical Security Infrastructure ABB is salient for technical interoperability because it provides the infrastructure capable of providing functionalities of data protection and privacy.

Identifier: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/PhysicalSecurityInfrastructureEquipment&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/PhysicalSecurityInfrastructureEquipment&lt;/a&gt;

