  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ComputingHostingNetworkingandDataHostingInfrastructureTechnologyService">
    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Computing Hosting, Networking, and Data Hosting Infrastructure</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: Computing Hosting, Networking, and Data Hosting Infrastructure ABB are a Technology Service that enables the functionalities for i) hosting Interoperable European Solutions and ii) providing the necessary networks for operating these solutions.

Source: ISA2 - EIA Action

Source reference: &lt;a href=&quot;https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/news/isa2-interoperability-solutions-european-public-administrations-first-work-programme-adopted&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/news/isa2-interoperability-sol…&lt;/a&gt;

Example: The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB):DIGIT Hosting and Networking Infrastructure Service

IoP Dimension: Structural IoP

LOST view: Technical view - Infrastructure

Interoperability saliency: The Computing Hosting, Networking and Data Hosting Infrastructure ABB is a key enabler interoperability enabler (*) for structural interoperability by enabling all the functionalities to host the Interoperable European Solutions  (high availability and high-performance hosting infrastructure) and the network that can operate these solutions (a public and private network). Hosting and networking represent the lower level of the technical layer, but to be considered when designing an interoperable solution, as they can create interoperability barriers. Interoperability technical specifications need to be used at this level to ensure interoperability of the levels above.

Identifier: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ComputingHosting,Networking,andDataHostingInfrastructureTechnologyService&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ComputingHosting,Networking,andDataHostingInf…&lt;/a&gt;

eira:ID: ABB439

ABB name: eira:ComputingHosting,Networking,andDataHostingInfrastructureTechnologyService

EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2022-31-01</skos:definition>
    <skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/viewpoint/KeyInteroperabilityEnablersViewpoint"/>
    <ns1:properties rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">{&quot;namespaces&quot;:{&quot;rdf&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;rdf:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/1999\/02\/22-rdf-syntax-ns#&quot;},&quot;skos&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;skos:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#&quot;},&quot;dct&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;dct:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/purl.org\/dc\/terms\/&quot;},&quot;eira&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;eira:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/&quot;}},&quot;rows&quot;:[{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;rdf:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#Concept&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:notation&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of Computing Hosting, Networking, and Data Hosting Infrastructure&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/ComputingHostingNetworkingandDataHostingInfrastructureTechnologyService_Properties&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/ComputingHostingNetworkingandDataHostingInfrastructureTechnologyService&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:prefLabel&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of Computing Hosting, Networking, and Data Hosting Infrastructure&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:PURI&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/ComputingHostingNetworkingandDataHostingInfrastructureTechnologyService&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:ComputingHostingNetworkingandDataHostingInfrastructureTechnologyService&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:modified&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;2022-01-31&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:definition&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Computing Hosting, Networking, and Data Hosting Infrastructure ABB are a Technology Service that enables the functionalities for i) hosting Interoperable European Solutions and ii) providing the necessary networks for operating these solutions.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSource&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;ISA2 - EIA Action&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSourceReference&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu\/en\/news\/isa2-interoperability-solutions-european-public-administrations-first-work-programme-adopted&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:example&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB):DIGIT Hosting and Networking Infrastructure Service&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopSaliency&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The Computing Hosting, Networking and Data Hosting Infrastructure ABB is a key enabler interoperability enabler (*) for structural interoperability by enabling all the functionalities to host the Interoperable European Solutions  (high availability and high-performance hosting infrastructure) and the network that can operate these solutions (a public and private network). Hosting and networking represent the lower level of the technical layer, but to be considered when designing an interoperable solution, as they can create interoperability barriers. Interoperability technical specifications need to be used at this level to ensure interoperability of the levels above.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:concept&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Structural IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:view&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Technical view - infrastructure&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:viewpoint&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Interoperability Security viewpoint&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:viewpoint&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Highlevel viewpoint&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:viewpoint&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Key Interoperability Enablers viewpoint&quot;}]}</ns1:properties>
    <skos:related>
      <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ContentDeliveryInfrastructureEnablers">
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Content Delivery Infrastructure Enablers</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: Content Delivery Infrastructure Enablers ABB is a Grouping that refers to the set of components and services that enable the delivery of digital content such as web pages, videos, images, and audio files to end-users

Source: Inspired in the definition provided by relebant cloud service organizations.

Example: The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): DIGIT/C Hosting Service - DIGIT/C offers a high availability and high performance hosting infrastructure that is being comprised, among other elements, of back-end web server instances and application servers for hosting and serving both static and dynamic sites. &lt;a href=&quot;http://ec.europa.eu/ipg/build/infrastructure/index_en.htm&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://ec.europa.eu/ipg/build/infrastructure/index_en.htm&lt;/a&gt;

LOST view: Technical view - Infrastructure

Interoperability saliency: Content Delivery Infrastructure Enablers ABB is salient for semantic and technical interoperability because it provides ICT systems to manipulate, reuse and share batch and streaming data related to public administration services.

Identifier: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ContentDeliveryInfrastructureEnablers&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ContentDeliveryInfrastructureEnablers&lt;/a&gt;

eira:ID: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ContentDeliveryInfrastructureEnablers&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ContentDeliveryInfrastructureEnablers&lt;/a&gt;

ABB name: eira:ContentDeliveryInfrastructureEnablers

EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock</skos:definition>
        <skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/view/TechnicalView-Infrastructure"/>
