  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/SubsidiarityAndProportionality">
    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Subsidiarity and proportionality</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">DEFINITION:
Subsidiarity and proportionality ABB is a Principle requiring EU decisions to be taken as closely as possible to the citizen

Source: Europarl
(&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.europarl.europa.eu/factsheets/en/sheet/7/the-principle-of-subsidiarity&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://www.europarl.europa.eu/factsheets/en/sheet/7/the-principle-of-s…&lt;/a&gt;)

