    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Service Orientation</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">DEFINITION:
Service orientation ABB is a Principle facilitating a way of thinking in terms of services and service-based development and the outcomes of services.

Source: Europa
(&lt;a href=&quot;https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/sites/default/files/isa_annex_ii_eif_en.pdf&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/sites/default/files/isa_annex_ii_eif_en.pdf&lt;/a&gt;)

