  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/EvidenceBasedPublicPolicy">
    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Evidence based Public Policy</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">DEFINITION:
Evidence-based Public Policy ABB is a Principle looking at experimental evidences and incontrovertible data.
The primary goal is to improve the reliability of advice concerning the efficiency and effectiveness of policy settings and possible alternatives.


Source: (Baron, Jon (1 July 2018). &quot;A Brief History of Evidence-Based Policy&quot;)

EXAMPLES:
The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB):

There are three crucial enabling factors that underpin modern conceptions of evidence-based policy (EBP): high-quality information bases on relevant topic areas, cohorts of professionals with skills in data analysis and policy evaluation, and political incentives for utilising evidence-based analysis and advice in governmental decision-making processes.</skos:definition>
    <skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/Deprecated"/>
    <ns1:properties rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">{&quot;namespaces&quot;:{&quot;rdf&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;rdf:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/1999\/02\/22-rdf-syntax-ns#&quot;},&quot;skos&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;skos:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#&quot;},&quot;dct&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;dct:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/purl.org\/dc\/terms\/&quot;},&quot;owl&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;owl:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2002\/07\/owl#&quot;},&quot;eira&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;eira:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/&quot;}},&quot;rows&quot;:[{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;rdf:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#Concept&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:notation&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of Evidence based Public Policy&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/EvidenceBasedPublicPolicy_Properties&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:prefLabel&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of Evidence based Public Policy&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;owl:deprecated&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;true&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:EvidenceBasedPublicPolicy&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:modified&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;2023-05-25&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:ABB_Status&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Obsolete&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:ID&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;ABB409&quot;}]}</ns1:properties>
