  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ConvergenceAssuranceOnPublicPolicyGoalsAttainment">
    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Convergence assurance on public policy goals attainment</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">DEFINITION:
Convergence assurance on public policy goals attainment ABB is a Principle assessing the effectiveness of realisation of public services, based on public policies, by evaluating various technological solutions when striving to ensure the effectiveness and efficiency of a European public service.

Source: Europarl
(&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.europarl.europa.eu/RegData/etudes/IDAN/2018/614502/IPOL_IDA(2018)614502_EN.pdf&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://www.europarl.europa.eu/RegData/etudes/IDAN/2018/614502/IPOL_IDA…&lt;/a&gt;)

