lications\/data-governance-and-data-policies-european-commission_en&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:example&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): Context Broker as a CEF Building Block. https:\/\/ec.europa.eu\/digital-building-blocks\/wikis\/download\/attachments\/82773424\/Context%20Broker%20Brochure.pdf?version=1\u0026modificationDate=1558016168498\u0026api=v2&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopSaliency&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The Data Management Enablers Grouping ABB is salient for technical interoperability because it comprises the tools, components and services related to data management. Data Management Enablers are relevant as they support effective and efficient data management, ensuring that interoperability can be achieved between digital public services.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:concept&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:PURI&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/DataManagementEnablersGrouping&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Structural IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Behavioral IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:view&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Technical view - application&quot;}]}</ns1:properties>
